OL,3,GNEWSAFort Regent revamp 'taking longer
OL,4,Athan expected'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA project to upgrade Fort Regent is
OL,7,Ftaking longer than expected, officials
OL,8,Fhave said.
OL,10,FJersey Development Company's plans for
OL,11,Fthe #110m revamp in St Helier, includes
OL,12,Fa 2,500-seat theatre, a 12-lane bowling
OL,13,Falley, a six-screen cinema, play areas,
OL,14,Fclimbing and bouldering facilities and
OL,15,Fplaces to eat and drink.
OL,17,FThe island's government said the scheme
OL,18,Fwas delayed, partly due to the election
OL,19,Fperiod and partly because of
OL,20,Frefinements to the scope of works
OL,21,Fwithin phase one of the project.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
