OL,3,GNEWSAFort Regent revamp 'taking longer
OL,4,Athan expected'
OL,5,
OL,6,FOfficial said #43m already approved for
OL,7,FFort Regent remained in the 2027 budget
OL,8,Fproposals and project leaders were
OL,9,Fcommitted to the first phase of works.
